rrior-contracts-2", "storyline": "Set in late 2019, Sniper Ghost Warrior Contracts 2 follows a sniper mercenary known only as Raven, hired to bring down the brutal regime of Bibi Rashida, dictator of the fictional Middle Eastern nation of Kuamar. Working alone and guided remotely by an anonymous handler called Control, Raven operates deep in hostile territory, taking on a series of high-value contracts designed to dismantle Rashida's grip on power piece by piece. His campaign begins in the rugged Zindah Province, where he is tasked with eliminating the key figures who keep the regime running, among them a ruthless arms dealer, a veteran sniper trainer, and a foreign intelligence specialist. Each target is engaged from extreme range across sprawling, open environments, some demanding shots from well over a kilometer away. As Raven works methodically through Rashida's network of enforcers and allies, the mercenary edges ever closer to the heart of a regime he has been paid to topple.", "summary": "SGW Contracts 2 is a modern warfare shooter with the story set in the Middle East. You play as a Raven, contract sniper assassin in a dramatic single-player campaign featuring extreme long-range shots.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sniper-ghost-warrior-contracts-2", "videos": [{"id": 126776, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "qlozPd7cNwE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qlozPd7cNwE", "title": "Kill Shot 1506 meters - Sniper Ghost Warrior Contracts 2 Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qlozPd7cNwE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 126777, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "36mfp4GYLX4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36mfp4GYLX4", "title": "Sniper Ghost Warrior Contracts 2 - Official Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/36mfp4GYLX4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 126778, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "NYysxaq6mas", "url": "https:/